## What I Learned

### Strategy Comes Before Scaling

Building a product is only one part of creating a successful startup.

A clear business strategy provides direction for growth, marketing, pricing, and customer acquisition.

### Revenue Must Be Planned

A startup should understand how it creates, delivers, and captures value before investing heavily in development.

### Customer Acquisition Is Critical

Even an excellent product will struggle without a repeatable way to reach users.

### AI Accelerates Strategic Thinking

Claude helped organize complex business concepts into a structured and actionable strategy.

